  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0029741_Ans.jpg\" style=\"width: 194px; height: 144px;\" /><br /><br />From the law of conservation of mechanical energy,<br /><br />Final energy = Translational kinetic energy + Rotational kinetic energy<br /><br />Hence, Final energy =&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>mv</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>I&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>mv</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>mR</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>mv</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br />Hence, we finally obtain,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>mg</mtext><mfenced><mtext>R - r</mtext></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mtext>mv</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; .......(1)<br /><br />and&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mtext>N</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>mg</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>mv</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>R - r</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;..........(2)<br /><br />Solving Eqs. (1) and (2), we get<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mtext>N</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>7</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>7</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mtext>mg</mtext> </mrow></math>",
    "image": null
  },
